          "Lead with aging homeowner economic security: a 49.7 median age and $52,570 income with near-80% homeownership means the district's core constituency is living on fixed or near-fixed incomes while facing rising healthcare costs, rural service decline, and home maintenance pressures — Medicare, rural hospital access, and prescription costs are the issues this constituency feels most acutely.",
