          "Lead on working-class economic security with income-specific specificity: at $53,817 median household income and 15.5% college attainment, this is a district where healthcare affordability, wage growth, and stable employment are personal financial realities, not abstract policy debates — incumbents who deliver concrete wins on these fronts reinforce the 78% coalition at its base.",
