          "Engage the 39.71% white constituency with economic specificity rather than cultural signaling; at this income level, white working-class voters in HD-63 share material concerns about wages, healthcare costs, and economic opportunity that overlap substantially with the district's Black majority and represent a genuine coalition expansion opportunity.",
