          "Build a visible workforce and economic mobility agenda: at 13.9% college attainment and $38,990 median income, the district's working-age majority needs concrete wins on job quality, wage floors, vocational pathways, and access to healthcare — not positioning statements, but trackable legislative outcomes.",
