          "Engage the 11.45% Hispanic community and the small residual gap population with specific constituent attention — in a district where the majority-Black narrative dominates, Hispanic renters and workers at $36,099 median income face overlapping economic pressures that deserve direct outreach rather than absorption into a generic minority-community message.",
