          "Engage the 19.44% Hispanic or Latino community with the same specificity as the Black plurality — bilingual outreach, constituent services accessible to Spanish-speaking residents, and attention to workforce and immigration-adjacent economic issues that affect this community's stability are necessary for a genuinely representative office, not optional additions.",
