          "Lead with renter-specific economic issues: housing affordability, landlord accountability, and tenant protections are the material concerns of 43.7% of this district's households, and a representative who delivers tangible results on these issues builds the kind of cross-racial, income-based coalition that makes a seat durable rather than accidentally uncontested.",
