          "Do not allow an unopposed win to substitute for genuine outreach — the most predictable path to losing a currently uncontested seat is governing as though the absence of a 2024 opponent means the absence of dissatisfied constituents; at this income level and demographic complexity, dissatisfaction is latent, not absent."
