          "Resist the governance complacency that 81% margins produce: the 15.6% college attainment rate and working-class income profile mean this constituency is acutely sensitive to real-world service delivery failures — rural infrastructure, healthcare access, and economic opportunity — and will notice when a legislator's attention drifts to higher-profile arenas."
