          "Invest specifically in the 18.2% Hispanic community with language-accessible constituent services and explicit attention to workforce and housing issues that affect this constituency distinctly — at nearly one-in-five residents, the Hispanic community is large enough that neglect registers electorally as lower turnout, not persuasion loss.",
