          "Lead with working-class economic priorities — at $53,242 median income and 15.4% college attainment, the district's workforce is concentrated in sectors where wages, job stability, healthcare costs, and infrastructure directly determine quality of life, and specific policy fluency on these issues is the surest way to convert an uncontested hold into a durable coalition.",
