          "Build explicit constituent relationships with the 10.96% Hispanic community: in Arkansas's rural districts, this population is heavily concentrated in agricultural and poultry processing workforces, and their practical needs around labor conditions, healthcare access, and government services are distinct and often underserved by a one-size agenda.",
